1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:03,150
Every sign on this
street was once a person.

2
00:00:03,250 --> 00:00:03,680
Even me.

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:05,780
I was a bouncer,
forty years ago.

4
00:00:05,730 --> 00:00:07,000
You? You're a cat.

5
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:08,210
The club was called the Cat.

6
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:09,190
I have no luck.

7
00:00:09,590 --> 00:00:10,810
Fifty minutes left.

8
00:00:10,810 --> 00:00:12,840
So I knocked on every name.

9
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:13,890
Ruth says run.

10
00:00:13,890 --> 00:00:14,790
Otis says hide.

11
00:00:14,790 --> 00:00:16,910
Pete says he left the oven on.

12
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,490
And what do you say?

13
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:19,960
I say, ask for help.

14
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,270
I don't do that.

15
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:23,230
I know. Nine years,
and not once.

16
00:00:23,930 --> 00:00:27,460
Then, at the end of the row,
I found a board with no name.

17
00:00:27,850 --> 00:00:29,430
Mara. It's already wired.

18
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:31,790
And it was exactly my size.

19
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:33,860
It's warming up.
It's warming up!

20
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:35,420
We ran for the door.

21
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:37,330
She was standing in front of it.

22
00:00:37,330 --> 00:00:38,320
The other me.

23
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:39,950
Please. Move.

24
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:41,820
Mara, she has the key.

25
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:43,260
She looked me in the eye.

26
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:44,690
And she locked us in.
